--TEST--
the suppression is one-directional: resolution and the type check read the same whole tree, so a file with one of each publishes both, `rule:ide/diagnostics-are-phase-gated`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Greeter {
    public function count(): int {
        return "not an int";
    }
}
var $stray = $nope;
--REQUEST--
diagnostics
--EXPECT--
4:16-4:28 error E0403 this method declares `int` but returns `string`
7:14-7:19 error E0301 `$nope` is not declared
